OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man-Belfast City flights  
OL,4,Aset to return                          
OL,6,FDirect flights between the Isle of Man 
OL,7,Fand Belfast City Airport are to return 
OL,8,Fnext spring, Loganair has announced.   
OL,10,FThe three-times-weekly service will    
OL,11,Fstart on 29 March, with extra flights  
OL,12,Flaid on during the TT races.           
OL,14,FIsle of Man Airport director Mark      
OL,15,FBeveridge said restoring the route     
OL,16,F"fills an important gap in the Island's
OL,17,Fair connectivity".                     
OL,19,FThe airline is also adding weekend     
OL,20,Fmorning flights to London Heathrow to  
OL,21,Fits summer 2027 schedule.              
